        <detaileddescription>
<para>Optional session language as a BCP-47 tag (&quot;de&quot;, &quot;de-DE&quot;, &quot;pt-BR&quot;). One setting the whole voice + text stack derives from: it becomes the default <computeroutput>tts_lang</computeroutput> for every GenerateAndSpeak/Speak node, the language hint for multilingual STT models, <computeroutput>loc/&lt;<ref refid="struct_tryll_1_1_client_1_1_tryll_client_1_1_session_config_1a9a094afb56e8e27de2a699fb42490d4e" kindref="member">locale</ref>&gt;/</computeroutput> siblings relative storage paths prefer, and the <computeroutput>language</computeroutput> Mustache key templates can write a &quot;reply in X&quot; directive against. Empty = unset (every one of those keeps its pre-locale behaviour). A malformed tag is rejected with <computeroutput>InvalidLocale</computeroutput> (2004). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
